{"id":"e5a406a5f0e00015","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-forcing-dot-generic.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Dot Generic","display":"df-zfc-forcing-dot-generic — ZFC Forcing Dot Generic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-dot-generic","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-dot-generic","58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-name"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-dot-generic — ZFC Forcing Dot Generic","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing-canonical-check-name]]","[[58-df-ordered-pair]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-dot-generic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-dot-generic</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-name</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-dot-generic — ZFC Forcing Dot Generic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fb43b1e2c83c0e1a\" href=\"?note=fb43b1e2c83c0e1a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-canonical-check-name\">58-df-zfc-forcing-canonical-check-name</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bea77fab814b3292\" href=\"?note=bea77fab814b3292\" title=\"58-df-ordered-pair\">58-df-ordered-pair</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot G,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},\\sigma\\in V\">\\(\\dot G,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},\\sigma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\)</span> (forcing-poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S\\)</span> (canonical-check-name predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fb43b1e2c83c0e1a\" href=\"?note=fb43b1e2c83c0e1a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-canonical-check-name\">58-df-zfc-forcing-canonical-check-name</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingDotGeneric}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingDotGeneric}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}dot\\text{-}generic} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingDotGeneric}_S(\\dot{G},\\mathbb{P},\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\forall z\\;\\Bigl(z\\in\\dot G\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\exists\\sigma\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S(\\sigma,p,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land z=\\langle\\sigma,p\\rangle\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}dot\\text{-}generic} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingDotGeneric}_S(\\dot{G},\\mathbb{P},\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\forall z\\;\\Bigl(z\\in\\dot G\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\exists\\sigma\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S(\\sigma,p,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land z=\\langle\\sigma,p\\rangle\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot G\">\\(\\dot G\\)</span> contains exactly the pairs <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\check p,p\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\check p,p\\rangle\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathbb P\">\\(p\\in\\mathbb P\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The canonical-check-name call now has the five arguments required by its source atom; the former three-argument call was undefined.</li>\n<li>The legacy generic-name note label remains a frontmatter alias; the formal atom defines only the canonical generic-filter name.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-canonical-check-name","status":"resolved","id":"fb43b1e2c83c0e1a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing-canonical-check-name]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordered-pair","status":"resolved","id":"bea77fab814b3292","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordered-pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S$ (forcing-poset predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-canonical-check-name","status":"resolved","id":"fb43b1e2c83c0e1a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S$ (canonical-check-name predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-forcing-canonical-check-name]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot G,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},\\sigma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingDotGeneric}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}dot\\text{-}generic} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingDotGeneric}_S(\\dot{G},\\mathbb{P},\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\forall z\\;\\Bigl(z\\in\\dot G\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\exists\\sigma\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S(\\sigma,p,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land z=\\langle\\sigma,p\\rangle\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\dot G","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\check p,p\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathbb P","display":false}],"bytes":1730,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1957","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-forcing-dot-generic.md|58-df-zfc-forcing-dot-generic]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","b5833df5ef175153","fb43b1e2c83c0e1a","bea77fab814b3292"]}